{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["Come to Pharaoh, for I have hardened, etc. — in none of the plagues do we find that the Holy One, blessed be He, informed Moshe that He had strengthened his heart. But in this one, since Pharaoh admitted: ״I and my people are the wicked ones,״ and it is written of this: ״ויוסף לחטוא״, therefore it was necessary to say: כי אני הכבדתי וגו׳ ואת לב עבדיו — for thus it is written above: ״ויכבד לבו״." "שתי — שומי."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:40:55.794426485Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}